{"product_id":"constitutional-administrative-law-core-texts-series","title":"Constitutional \u0026 Administrative Law (Core Texts Series)","description":"\u003cp\u003eConstitutional and Administrative Law guides readers through the key principles of public law, examining significant cases and recent developments along the way. The book's broad coverage is presented in a concise and easy-to-read format, while chapter summaries and self-test questions help reinforce knowledge. Highly praised by students and lecturers alike, Constitutional and Administrative Law is a must for undergraduates of all levels.Online Resource CentreThe book is supported online an Online Resource Centre, offering the following useful resources:Interactive timeline'Oxford NewsNow' RSS feeds provide constantly refreshed links to the latest relevant new storiesWeb linksMultiple choice questions\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 178 x 254\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Neil Parpworth\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780198747529\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 552\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45662143676569,"sku":"EDU-2-A9780198747529","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68a7dbaf81cdf_Constitutional___Administrative_Law__Core_Texts_Series__Neil_Parpworth.png?v=1755875749","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/constitutional-administrative-law-core-texts-series","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}